<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

  <parent>
    <groupId>ai.neargo.sharehub</groupId>
    <artifactId>sharehub-parent</artifactId>
    <version>0.1.0-SNAPSHOT</version>
    <relativePath>../pom.xml</relativePath>
  </parent>

  <artifactId>sharehub-app-gateway</artifactId>
  <name>sharehub-app-gateway</name>
  <description>
    device-gateway 的**微服务形态**启动模块（ADR-017 §5.1）。

    它与 `sharehub-app`（单体形态）的差别**只有依赖列表**：本模块只依赖 svc-gateway，
    单体依赖全部 5 个 svc。两者共用同一份 svc 代码，**svc 一行不改**。

    这就是「一套代码两种部署」的证明点：
    · classpath 上有 svc-core 的本地实现 → Port 走方法调用（单体）；
    · classpath 上没有 → `@ConditionalOnMissingBean` 装配 HTTP 实现（微服务）。
    **装配由 classpath 决定而非配置**，所以配置写错不会导致装配错误，最坏是 fail-fast。

    ⚠️ **当前是最小可启动骨架**：Port 的远程实现（`api/*/remote`）尚未编写，
    故本模块目前只能验证「模块结构成立 + 能独立启动」，还不能真正跨进程调用。
  </description>
  <packaging>jar</packaging>

  <dependencies>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>ai.neargo.sharehub</groupId>
      <artifactId>sharehub-svc-gateway</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
      <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.baomidou</groupId>
      <artifactId>mybatis-plus-spring-boot4-starter</artifactId>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.mysql</groupId>
      <artifactId>mysql-connector-j</artifactId>
      <scope>runtime</scope>
    </dependency>
  </dependencies>

  <build>
    <plugins>
            <!-- 模块边界（v4/12 §5.2）：网关启动模块：只带网关内核，不许把业务域链接进来 -->
            <plugin>
                <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
                <artifactId>maven-enforcer-plugin</artifactId>
                <executions>
                    <execution>
                        <id>module-boundary</id>
                        <goals><goal>enforce</goal></goals>
                        <configuration>
                            <rules>
                                <bannedDependencies>
                                    <excludes>
                                        <exclude>ai.neargo.sharehub:sharehub-svc-platform</exclude>
                                        <exclude>ai.neargo.sharehub:sharehub-svc-core</exclude>
                                        <exclude>ai.neargo.sharehub:sharehub-svc-ops</exclude>
                                        <exclude>ai.neargo.sharehub:sharehub-svc-finance</exclude>
                                        <exclude>ai.neargo.sharehub:sharehub-app</exclude>
                                    </excludes>
                                </bannedDependencies>
                            </rules>
                            <fail>true</fail>
                        </configuration>
                    </execution>
                </executions>
            </plugin>
        
      <plugin>
        <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
        <artifactId>spring-boot-maven-plugin</artifactId>
      </plugin>
    </plugins>
  </build>
</project>
